Contract: `RunAll` starts every job concurrently and returns only after every job has finished. The code is:

```go
func RunAll(jobs []func()) {
    var wg sync.WaitGroup
    for _, job := range jobs {
        job := job
        go func() {
            wg.Add(1)
            defer wg.Done()
            job()
        }()
    }
    wg.Wait()
}
```

Does this meet the contract? If not, name the bug and give the minimal fix.
